WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:07,920
What kind of mother is this? My mother?

2
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,870
That’s six hundred pounds, right?

3
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:17,620
The meat is used to protect the head and every family has longevity.

4
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:20,060
This is what you fought back with your life

5
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:24,010
The mountain is the mountain that backs the village. I guard the mountain behind it.

6
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:30,210
Everyone, follow me and eat meat together
